ithub.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-28T06:31:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T18:07:05Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-02T02:38:01Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway","homepage":null,"size":147329,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":14,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":14,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"## Parent\n\n[实施规格 #9：CPAR 现有渠道可靠性与管理体验收敛](https://github.com/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/issues/9)\n\n## What to build\n\n接入或管理动作提交时，自动处理没有旧修改的情况；有旧修改则核对完整清单后应用，也可保留待应用。\n\n实施编号 CPAR-02；实施批次：A。覆盖用户故事 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 52；验收场景 T03, T04。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] 从一个真实普通账号导入／管理动作演示无旧修改时保存、校验、自动发布及分阶段反馈。\n- [x] 有旧修改时展示旧修改与本次修改的合并清单，明确选择应用或保留；不得静默夹带旧修改。\n- [x] 核对后活动版本或 revision 变化时重新读取与核对；不能用旧清单覆盖并发修改。\n- [x] 校验失败保留已保存事实；普通配置发布保持原子性及原有效快照，不把独立凭据更新说成已回滚。\n- [x] HTTP 受控冲突与丢响应、EgoLite 清单核对／保留／恢复路径通过，权限不自动扩大。\n- [x] 记录受影响行为的高层本地验证、必要的 EgoLite 产品验收与审查证据；静态存在、fixture、真实渠道和生产结论分开，结果使用 PASS／FAIL／NOT_RUN／BLOCKED。\n- [x] 保留账号／渠道／权限及数据边界；涉及权威管理契约时单向同步生成客户端，遵守既有前后端归属与跨边界记录；必要 ADR 与相关陈旧测试入口随本切片修正。\n- [x] 在实际 checkout 上复核范围，完成适用 Task／Phase 门槛；本票不自动授权真实账号、收费请求、服务变更或部署，具体外部操作以已明确目标和范围为准。\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- [#10](https://github.com/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/issues/10)：普通账号导入如实反馈保存与生效。原因：复用已经区分保存、生效和未知结果的回执，避免在新应用流程中再次推断成功。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/issues/11/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ricardo121380/cpa-rust-gateway/issues/11/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}]
